# Development-only files. They must not reach the published snapshot (git archive).

# A symlink to AGENTS.md, which is the file the README names. git archive writes it as a
# 9-byte entry, and an unzip that ignores the symlink bit -- Windows Explorer, 7-Zip --
# leaves a broken file where the guide should be.
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
